35,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The support records are worrying. Last winter, the outage sat unowned for two days. We need a single throat to choke.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,My findings confirm the hardware is a patchwork. The 2021 trial failed because the devices couldn’t sync. We need a system that works on old terminals.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,I found that the dispatch tool skipped three upgrades because testing was too heavy. And the 2018 pay move had a bad data lift. We need a system that is easy to upgrade and migrate.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"I found that two key administrators are leaving, and the last rollout’s training was ignored by supervisors. We need a system that is easy to learn and doesn’t rely on a few experts.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I found that bundled agreements held their price, while separately licensed pieces climbed yearly. And the board trims capital but passes operating lines easily. We need a system with a fixed, bundled price that doesn’t rely on capital approval.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, if the hardware is a patchwork, a hosted system might be safer. It doesn’t depend on our old terminals.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, hosted systems still need the terminals to connect. If the terminals can’t sync, the cloud is useless. We need a system that works with our existing hardware.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, I agree. But a system that is easy to upgrade is also important. If we can’t test it, we can’t fix it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, and if the training is ignored, the system is useless. We need a system that is intuitive, so the supervisors don’t have to be retaught.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, a hosted system might have a fixed price, but it often comes with hidden data transfer fees. I need to see the total cost of ownership.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, I understand. But a single vendor with a fixed price is better than four suppliers pointing at each other.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, I agree. But the vendor must be able to work with our old hardware. If they can’t, we’re stuck.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, and the vendor must be able to upgrade the system easily. If they can’t, we’re stuck with a system that rots.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, and the vendor must be able to train the staff easily. If they can’t, we’re stuck with a system that the staff ignores.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, I agree. A single vendor with a fixed price is the only way to avoid the hidden costs. But we need to make sure the price is truly fixed.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,Let’s see the candidates. I hope one of them offers a single owner and a flexible plan.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I hope one of them works with our old hardware and fits our tight calendar.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"I hope one of them is easy to upgrade and migrate, so it doesn’t rot.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I hope one of them is easy to learn and doesn’t rely on a few experts, so the staff can actually use it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I hope one of them has a fixed, bundled price that doesn’t rely on capital approval, so the bill doesn’t keep arriving.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
